        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjURLJR1c6tnmkG-ikJW5llmZ8XOG0JtzYAhuoJH-eAkCPMbAXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Excellent customer service.  Polite staff. Good attention to detail. Quick turn around on the services provided.",
        "time": 1767901924,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shelley Federico",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116700341481709278869/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV_uZZa2JsEqhybS6Op5apSF4qbaBQoJS7wJhaElEK2cwRwfAQu=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Vitroplus installed a new windshield for my Subaru Forester in a timely manner. Very happy with the service and affordability. They were professional and friendly, and there was a comfortable sitting area.",
        "time": 1764212076,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anna Lepine",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116086168814460115585/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJcN3-ToEkbuMb-oGB5a9bSMZXbnr8_TY0gWy7Z0kUuuhl4XA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I am really disappointed with the service I received. I had had a trailer hitch installed about 5 years ago and had great service, no issues. This time, they never offered me the tow ball attachment, so when I went to use the trailer hitch, it was unusable. When I wrote to enquire, they claimed that they would never offer such a thing because it comes in different sizes (However, they DID offer it the first time). Putting aside whether they do or do not offer the tow ball attachment, their response was so rude and dismissive that I will definitely never go to this location again. They do not value their customers. Go somewhere else.",
        "time": 1756153193,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie France",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112484038265677433599/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUIqFOmTKdxd1B6k5rsE-qCFcwlKfXNz4ePl02P4VkgM9vedr2m=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Easy to set up an appointment. Friendly reception desk. Repair on windshield went smoothly. Hassle-free with paperwork. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1755695919,
        "translated": false
      }
